<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { description: area.intro }) %>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main id="main" class="dedicated-solution">
<section class="page-hero"><%- include('partials/hero-background') %><div class="wrap"><a class="breadcrumb" href="/">Home /</a> <a class="breadcrumb" href="/solutions">Solutions /</a> <span class="breadcrumb"><%= area.label %></span><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><%= area.number %> / <%= area.label %></p><h1><%= area.title %></h1></div><p class="intro"><%= area.intro %></p></div></div></section>
  <section id="<%= area.id %>" class="solution-detail"><div class="wrap section"><div class="detail-grid"><div><h3 class="detail-subtitle">When this matters</h3><p><%= area.challenge %></p><h3 class="detail-subtitle">What to consider</h3><div class="capability-list"><% area.capabilities.forEach(capability => { %><article><h4><%= capability[0] %></h4><p><%= capability[1] %></p></article><% }); %></div></div><aside class="technology-panel"><p class="eyebrow">RELEVANT TECHNOLOGIES</p><% area.partners.forEach(partner => { %><div class="technology-item"><h3><%= partner[0] %></h3><p><%= partner[1] %></p></div><% }); %><a class="text-link" href="/partners">Explore the portfolio ↗</a></aside></div><div class="discussion-strip"><div><span class="eyebrow">A GOOD PLACE TO START</span><p><%= area.discussion %></p></div><a class="button" href="mailto:rabindra@tslab.in?subject=<%= encodeURIComponent('Solution enquiry: '+area.label) %>">Discuss this solution ↗</a></div></div></section>

<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE OTHER SOLUTIONS</p><div class="solution-overview-grid"><% areas.filter(item => item.id !== area.id).forEach(item => { %><a class="solution-overview-card" href="/solutions/<%= item.id %>"><span class="eyebrow"><%= item.number %> /</span><h3><%= item.label %></h3><span>Explore solution ↗</span></a><% }); %></div></section>
  <section class="services section"><div class="wrap service-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM SELECTION TO SUPPORT</p><h2>The technology is<br><em>only the beginning.</em></h2><p>TS Lab’s value-added services help connect your priorities to a practical implementation. We’ll discuss the scope, configuration and support you need before you move ahead.</p><a class="button" href="/contact">Plan your next step ↗</a></div><div><% [['Solution consulting','Review your needs and identify suitable technology options.'],['Deployment support','Get assistance with implementation and configuration.'],['Technical assistance','Work through technical questions with our team.'],['Training & enablement','Help administrators, partners and users build practical knowledge.'],['Post-sales support','Continue the conversation after your solution goes live.']].forEach((item,i) => { %><div class="service-row"><span>0<%= i+1 %></span><div><h3><%= item[0] %></h3><p><%= item[1] %></p></div></div><% }); %></div></div></section>
  <section class="wrap section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE WE TALK</p><h2>A few useful answers.</h2></div></div><div class="solution-faq"><details><summary>Can we start with one security requirement?</summary><p>Yes. Start with your immediate priority—such as backup, endpoint protection or branch connectivity. We can discuss how it fits your existing environment and any wider requirements.</p></details><details><summary>How do we choose between products?</summary><p>Share your current systems, device and user counts, key risks, operational needs and budget considerations. These help frame a suitable shortlist and a discussion of deployment and licensing requirements.</p></details><details><summary>Does every product include all the capabilities listed?</summary><p>No. The capabilities on this page describe solution areas across the portfolio. Availability depends on the chosen product, edition, licensing, supported platform and configuration. Confirm the specific scope with our team before purchase.</p></details><details><summary>What information should we bring to the first conversation?</summary><p>A brief outline of your challenge, existing tools, sites and users, priority systems, and intended timeline is a useful starting point. Avoid sending passwords, credentials or sensitive business data in an initial email.</p></details></div></section>
  <section class="portfolio section"><div class="wrap closing-cta"><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILD YOUR NEXT LAYER OF PROTECTION</p><h2>Let’s find the right fit.</h2><p>Tell us where you are today and what you need to protect next.</p></div><a class="button" href="/contact">Talk to TS Lab ↗</a></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body></html>
